{"product_id":"the-genius-files-2-never-say-genius","title":"The Genius Files #2: Never Say Genius","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe most exciting road trip in history continues! In this second book in the thrilling, New York Times bestselling adventure series, twelve-year-old twins Coke and Pepsi McDonald see the Midwest like you’ve never seen it before.They never asked to be geniuses. They never asked to get lowered into a basket of boiling French fries, either. And they certainly never asked to be frozen in soft-serve ice cream, stampeded in a wild stadium riot, or kidnapped on a high-speed roller coaster. But that's what happens when a red-haired villain named Archie Clone is chasing you across America. This just might be the most dangerous road trip in history—and the most awesome!With Dan Gutman’s laugh-out-loud humor and featuring photos and weird-but-true American tourist destinations like the National Mustard Museum, The Genius Files is a one-of-a-kind mix of geography and fun.Don't miss the next action-packed book, The Genius Files #3: You Only Die Twice!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Dan Gutman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780061827693\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738324820121,"sku":"16RA-1-9780061827693","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/11607961.jpg?v=1758564670","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-genius-files-2-never-say-genius","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}